---
import GuideLayout from '../../layouts/GuideLayout.astro';
const guide = {
  "title": "Thailand DTV for Pakistanis: Route & Preparation",
  "description": "Check the Destination Thailand Visa category, responsible mission and official e-Visa checklist before planning a long stay.",
  "intro": "Check the Destination Thailand Visa category, responsible mission and official e-Visa checklist before planning a long stay.",
  "sources": [
    {
      "title": "Islamabad embassy DTV announcement",
      "url": "https://islamabad.thaiembassy.org/en/content/announcement-destination-thailand-visa-dtv"
    },
    {
      "title": "Official Thai e-Visa portal",
      "url": "https://www.thaievisa.go.th/"
    }
  ],
  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "Start with the purpose",
      "paragraphs": [
        "The Islamabad embassy publishes a DTV announcement and the national portal lists DTV for workcation and eligible Thai soft-power activities. Check which category fits the real activity; a tourist application and a DTV application are different routes."
      ],
      "source": 0
    },
    {
      "heading": "Use the responsible mission",
      "paragraphs": [
        "Start with the portal’s nationality, location and residence questions and follow the mission it identifies. Do not copy a US mission’s fee or document-format rules into a Pakistan application. Location and evidence conditions must match your circumstances."
      ],
      "source": 1
    },
    {
      "heading": "Organise the evidence",
      "paragraphs": [
        "Prepare passport, location/residence, financial and activity evidence requested in the live checklist. Requirements differ between activities. A generic freelancer letter may not answer what the chosen category asks.",
        "Create an index showing which item supports each requirement. Check dates, name spellings and financial records. For translations, follow the responsible mission’s certification instructions rather than assuming all English translations are accepted."
      ],
      "source": 1
    },
    {
      "heading": "Confirm the actual terms",
      "paragraphs": [
        "Check the portal and embassy for the current fee, validity, permitted stay and extension conditions. Do not infer stay duration from multi-year visa validity, or treat an old USD conversion as a payable PKR amount. Read the issued permission and entry conditions."
      ],
      "source": 1
    },
    {
      "heading": "Plan a sustainable stay",
      "paragraphs": [
        "Budget accommodation, healthcare, travel and contingency costs separately from the fee. Confirm permitted activities and any tax or employment implications with the responsible authority or a qualified adviser. Keep application and decision records. A package seller cannot guarantee a government outcome."
      ],
      "source": 1
    }
  ]
};
---
<GuideLayout {...guide} />
